  "description": "Ultra-high-performance, near-zero-allocation HTML5-compliant tolerant parser for .NET 10. SIMD-accelerated and arena-backed, NkkinParser delivers industry-leading throughput and dramatically lower heap allocations compared to other .NET HTML parsers (e.g., AngleSharp, HtmlAgilityPack). Includes compiled selectors, streaming parsing, and BenchmarkDotNet benchmarks.",
